   "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/376?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui-dark.svg?v=3\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg?v=3\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg?v=3\" alt=\"Review in Change Stack →\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- recent_review_start -->\n\nNo actionable comments were generated in the recent review.\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/info.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Recent review info</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- review_info_content -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n- **Source mode**: Auto\n- **Repository**: [ezzz/HFRnow](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow>)\n- **Branch**: [fix/roadmap-capture-not-planned](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/tree/fix%2Froadmap-capture-not-planned>)\n- **File**: [.coderabbit.yaml](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/be1f3e858119de91e75203dcf3bf8652811c6a61/.coderabbit.yaml>)\n- **Commit**: [be1f3e8](<https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/commit/be1f3e858119de91e75203dcf3bf8652811c6a61>)\n- **Layers**: Repository YAML\n- **Review profile**: ASSERTIVE\n- **Plan**: Advanced\n- **Run ID**: `9f630bf1-8df3-499d-be2b-5ecc4aa88702`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/git-commit-horizontal-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/git-commit-horizontal.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Commits</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between d0622bda2ddfecd41225046f84dd61e00d56714b and be1f3e858119de91e75203dcf3bf8652811c6a61.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/file-plus-corner-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/file-plus-corner.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Files selected for processing: 2</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n* `scripts/tests/test_roadmap.py`\n* `tooling/roadmap/sync_state.py`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n**Included review availability:** This review used your included allowance. Your plan provides up to 10 included reviews per hour; 1 remain after this review.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- recent_review_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\nThe capture blocker check now evaluates referenced issue numbers and issue state. A test covers capture issues closed with state reasons `\"not_planned\"` or `\"duplicate\"`.\n\n**Changes: Capture blockers**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Capture blocker filtering** <br> `tooling/roadmap/sync_state.py`, `scripts/tests/test_roadmap.py`|The blocker check filters capture references by issue existence, state, and whether the issue is the lot issue. The test checks that a capture issue closed with `\"not_planned\"` or `\"duplicate\"` remains a blocker.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n**Estimated code review effort:** 2 (Simple) | ~5 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"be1f3e858119de91e75203dcf3bf8652811c6a61\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p2\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Bug fix\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n**Possibly related issues**\n\n- `ezzz/HFRnow#368` — The issue describes restoring blockers for known issues that still require triage. This change updates capture blocker handling and tests closed issues with specific state reasons.\n\n**Suggested labels:** `direct-pr`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> · up to <code>be1f3</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **⚪ Minimal** · up to `be1f3`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"be1f3e858119de91e75203dcf3bf8652811c6a61\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"be1f3e858119de91e75203dcf3bf8652811c6a61\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nThe change preserves the intended capture triage blockers without introducing a confirmed merge-blocking issue.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 4 · <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> 1</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> Failed checks: 1 warning</strong>\n\n|     Check name     |                                              Status                                              | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                               | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :---------------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ![Warning](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-warning.svg) | Docstring coverage is 0.00% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. Docstring coverage is scoped to functions touched by this diff with cyclomatic complexity of at least 2. Documentat… | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\"